message: "If you use these measurements or scripts, please cite the manuscript."
title: "Data and code for Before You Scale: Deciding First-Token Latency-SLO Attainability for LLM Serving with a Paired Probe"
abstract: >-
  Per-request paired-probe records from twelve commercial LLM serving stacks,
  the aggregates derived from them, and the analysis scripts that rebuild every
  table and number in the manuscript. Stack labels follow the manuscript; no
  provider, model or institutional identity is included.
